> A backward warp fixes the direction convention

Flow at a first-frame pixel is(dx,dy),pointing **into the second frame**.
To reconstruct the first frame,sample second(x+dx,y+dy). Positive dx is right;
positive dy is down in image coordinates. This is backward sampling,not a
forward scatter. Bilinear outside taps are zero. A detached coverage mask
marks full windows when sampled all-one coverage is at least.9999.

On an image with intensity x+4y,a half-pixel rightward sample gives
x+.5+4y away from the boundary. The last column has incomplete coverage and
is zeroed by the default complete-window policy. The core sampler’s position
derivative at an integer uses the mean of one-sided slopes;this is the stated
adaptation from the old sampler’s right-sided choice.
```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/flownets_warp.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  namespace m = n::models;
  const auto image = n::arange(0, 12).reshape({1, 3, 4, 1});
  const auto field = n::ones({1, 3, 4, 2}) * n::tensor({.5, 0.}).reshape({1, 1, 1, 2});
  const auto warped = m::FlowWarp(image, field);
  auto a = n::plot_tensor_map(n::reverse(image.reshape({3, 4}), {0}), 0, 11),
       b = n::plot_tensor_map(n::reverse(warped.value.reshape({3, 4}), {0}), 0, 11);
  a.title("Second-frame ramp").x_label("column").y_label("original row0 at bottom");
  b.title("Sample at x plus half a pixel")
      .x_label("column")
      .y_label("original row0 at bottom");
  const auto x = n::arange(-4., 4.01, .5).reshape({1, 1, 17, 1}) + n::zeros({1, 17, 1, 1}),
             y = n::arange(-4., 4.01, .5).reshape({1, 17, 1, 1}) + n::zeros({1, 1, 17, 1});
  const auto wheel = m::FlowColors(n::concat({x, y}, 3));
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  std::filesystem::create_directories("figures");
  n::save_image_grid(wheel.to(n::DType::Float32), "figures/flownets_direction.png", 1, 0, 1, 0,
                     0, 12);
  auto layout = dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1, 2);
  layout.add(a).add(b).size(1100, 500).fit_panels().save_svg("build/flownets_warp.svg");
  std::print("Warped top-left {:.3f},valid pixels {}/12;incomplete final column is zero.\n",
             warped.value.to_vector<double>()[0], n::sum(warped.valid).item());
}
